            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.29.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyakiini Omukama wa Yuda akeehongera Omukama wa Babbulooni, uwe na nyina, abaheereza be, abanyoro be, n'abakuru ab'ekikaali kye. Omu mwaka ogwa munaana ogw'engoma ye, akakwata Omukama wa Babbulooni yamukwata yamuta omu nkomo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "itungo erikaba liri omunju ya MUKAMA n'erikaba liri omu nju y'Omukama yalitwara, ebikwato eby'efeeza ebikaba biri omunju ya MUKAMA Solomooni Omukama wa Isirairi ebi akaba akozire, MUKAMA nkooku akaba amugambiire yabitematema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu ba Yerusaalemu boona, abanyoro boona, abasaija boona emanzi, abayankomo boona hamu bakahika omutwaro gumu; abafundi boona n'abaheesi; hatabeho n'omu ayasigaire, okwihaho abantu abakiraga okuba banaku omunsi egi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.17.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezek 17:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyakiini na uwe, akamutwara Babbulooni; nyina Omukama, abago, abanyoro be, n'abantu ab'ekitiinisa abarukumanywa, abo boona akabaiha Yerusaalemu, yagenda yabakwatira Babbulooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama wa Babbulooni, abasaija boona emanzi, abarukuhika kasanju, abafundi n'abaheesi aburukuhika orukumi rumu, akabatwara Babbulooni bali banyankomo, boona omulibo, bakaba bali bantu b'amaani kandi abasemeriire kurwana obulemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.37.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 37:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.17.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezek 17:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama wa Babbulooni, akakwata Matania isento nuwe yafoora MUKAMA omu kiikaro kye, ibara lye Mataniya yalihindura yamuruka Zedekiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
